Place host-provided sample device configuration files here (`.conf`, `.cfg`,
`.txt`, `.json`, `.xml`, …). Files in this directory are local-only inputs for
the INV4R pipeline and are intentionally **not committed** to git:

```
cp /path/to/your/device.cfg configs/
```

Keep this `.gitkeep` file; it keeps the empty folder tracked in git while all
actual config payloads stay out of version control.
